// ae350_e2.sdc — E2 : LCD + USB + AE350 + DDR3 (socle analyseur porté, fréquences la16.sdc V3).
create_clock -name clk50 -period 20 -waveform {0 10} [get_ports {clk}]
create_clock -name sclk -period 8.333 -waveform {0 4.166} [get_nets {u_usb_softphy_top/usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_20_phy_utmi/u_usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_phy_hs/sclk}] -add

// Reprise de usb_uart_loopback/src/usb_ref.sdc (Sipeed/Gowin) : le PHY
// fournit ses traversées entre 60/120/960 MHz, traitées comme asynchrones.
create_generated_clock -name CLK_48M -source [get_ports {clk}] -master_clock clk50 -divide_by 50 -multiply_by 48 [get_pins {u_pll_f/PLL_inst/CLKOUT0}]
create_generated_clock -name PHY_CLKOUT -source [get_pins {u_pll_f/PLL_inst/CLKOUT0}] -master_clock CLK_48M -divide_by 4 -multiply_by 5 [get_pins {u_pll_b/PLL_inst/CLKOUT1}]
create_generated_clock -name fclk_960M -source [get_pins {u_pll_f/PLL_inst/CLKOUT0}] -master_clock CLK_48M -divide_by 2 -multiply_by 40 [get_pins {u_pll_b/PLL_inst/CLKOUT0}]
create_generated_clock -name LCD_35M -source [get_ports {clk}] -master_clock clk50 -divide_by 30 -multiply_by 21 [get_pins {u_pll_lcd/PLL_inst/CLKOUT0}]
// DIAGNOSTIC ONLY: expose USB internal paths to measure data delay.
// Do not use cross-clock slack as a CDC pass or load this diagnostic build.

// horloges du SoC AE350 (la16.sdc V3) : bus 80 MHz + core 800 MHz + RTC 10 MHz
create_clock -name bus80_clk -period 12.5 -waveform {0 6.25} [get_pins {u_pll_ae350/u_pll/PLL_inst/CLKOUT0}]
create_clock -name core_clk -period 1.25 -waveform {0 0.625} [get_pins {u_pll_ae350/u_pll/PLL_inst/CLKOUT1}]
create_clock -name rtc_clk -period 100 -waveform {0 50} [get_pins {u_pll_ae350/u_pll/PLL_inst/CLKOUT4}]
create_clock -name ddr3_ref_clk -period 20 -waveform {0 10} [get_pins {u_soc/u_pll_ddr3/u_pll/PLL_inst/CLKOUT0}]
create_clock -name ddr3_mem_clk -period 3.333 -waveform {0 1.667} [get_pins {u_soc/u_pll_ddr3/u_pll/PLL_inst/CLKOUT2}]
create_clock -name ddr3_sys_clk -period 13.333 -waveform {0 6.667} [get_pins {u_soc/g_ddr.u_ddr/u_ip/gw3_top/u_ddr_phy_top/fclkdiv/CLKOUT}]


// UART : échantillonnage asynchrone par le récepteur matériel AE350 et par
// rx_sync[0:1] dans le pont. Le chemin entre les deux bascules reste analysé.
set_false_path -to [get_pins {u_pont/rx_sync_0_s0/D}]
set_false_path -to [get_pins {u_soc/u_ae350/u_RiscV_AE350_SOC/u_AE350_SOC/UART2_RXD}]

// G1 graphics CDC: palette/commit/status (AHB <-> pixel), line request/ack
// and dual-clock line RAM (DDR UI <-> pixel). No combinational transfer is
// used as a destination enable; mailbox payloads are held until acknowledged.

report_timing -setup -from_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -to_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -setup -from_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -to_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -setup -from_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -to_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -setup -from_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -to_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -hold -from_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -to_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -hold -from_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -to_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -hold -from_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -to_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -hold -from_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -to_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -recovery -from_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -to_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -recovery -from_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -to_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -recovery -from_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -to_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -recovery -from_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -to_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -removal -from_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -to_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -removal -from_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -to_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -removal -from_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -to_clock [get_clocks {PHY_CLKOUT}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -removal -from_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -to_clock [get_clocks {sclk}] -max_paths 20000 -max_common_paths 1
// Isolated point-to-point diagnostic measurements, not production constraints.
report_timing -setup -from [get_pins {u_usb_softphy_top/usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_20_phy_utmi/u_usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_phy_hs/i_rx_phy/u_cdr_serdes_x8_dx/fifo_rx/fifo_4to8_sub_inst/rbin_num_5_s0/Q}] -to [get_pins {u_usb_softphy_top/usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_20_phy_utmi/u_usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_phy_hs/i_rx_phy/u_cdr_serdes_x8_dx/fifo_rx/fifo_4to8_sub_inst/Equal.wq1_rptr_5_s0/D}] -max_paths 1 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -setup -from [get_pins {u_usb_softphy_top/usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_20_phy_utmi/u_usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_phy_hs/i_rx_phy/u_cdr_serdes_x8_dx/fifo_rx/fifo_4to8_sub_inst/Equal.rptr_4_s0/Q}] -to [get_pins {u_usb_softphy_top/usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_20_phy_utmi/u_usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_phy_hs/i_rx_phy/u_cdr_serdes_x8_dx/fifo_rx/fifo_4to8_sub_inst/Equal.wq1_rptr_4_s0/D}] -max_paths 1 -max_common_paths 1
report_timing -setup -from [get_pins {u_usb_softphy_top/usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_20_phy_utmi/u_usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_phy_hs/i_rx_phy/u_cdr_serdes_x8_dx/fifo_rx/fifo_4to8_sub_inst/Equal.rptr_3_s0/Q}] -to [get_pins {u_usb_softphy_top/usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_20_phy_utmi/u_usb2_0_softphy/u_usb_phy_hs/i_rx_phy/u_cdr_serdes_x8_dx/fifo_rx/fifo_4to8_sub_inst/Equal.wq1_rptr_3_s0/D}] -max_paths 1 -max_common_paths 1
